#: src/Admin/Pages/GlobalSettingsPage.php:318
msgid "Global Settings"
msgstr "全局设置"

#: src/Admin/Pages/GlobalSettingsPage.php:325
msgid ""
"Multisite network mode is not enabled. Global configuration is unavailable; "
"the plugin will always work in local site configuration mode."
msgstr ""
"未启用多站点网络模式。全局配置不可用，插件将始终在本地站点配置模式下工作。"

#: src/Admin/Pages/GlobalSettingsPage.php:327
msgid ""
"This plugin is not network-activated. Please enable \"Network Activate\" in "
"Network Admin → Plugins before using global shared mode."
msgstr ""
"此插件未网络激活。请在网络管理 → 插件中启用「网络激活」后再使用全局共享模式。"

#: src/Admin/Pages/GlobalSettingsPage.php:329
msgid ""
"When multisite network mode is enabled and the plugin is network-activated, "
"you can choose whether all sites share the same plugin configuration and "
"data."
msgstr ""
"当多站点网络模式启用且插件已网络激活时，您可以选择是否让所有站点共享相同的插"
"件配置和数据。"

#: src/Admin/Pages/GlobalSettingsPage.php:358
msgid "Global plugin configuration"
msgstr "全局插件配置"

#: src/Admin/Pages/GlobalSettingsPage.php:364
msgid "Off (each site keeps its own settings and data)"
msgstr "关闭（每个站点保留自己的设置和数据）"

#: src/Admin/Pages/GlobalSettingsPage.php:369
msgid "On (all sites in the current network share settings and data)"
msgstr "开启（当前网络中的所有站点共享设置和数据）"

#: src/Admin/Pages/GlobalSettingsPage.php:375
msgid ""
"When enabled, task queue settings, translation vendor configuration and "
"plugin data will be shared across all sites in the current network; when "
"disabled, each site uses its own independent settings and data."
msgstr ""
"启用时，任务队列设置、翻译厂商配置和插件数据将在当前网络的所有站点间共享；禁"
"用时，每个站点使用各自独立的设置和数据。"

#: src/Admin/Pages/GlobalSettingsPage.php:377
msgid ""
"To enable global sharing, please first activate this plugin network‑wide in "
"the Network Admin, then return here. While the plugin is not "
"network‑activated, only local site configuration is available."
msgstr ""
"要启用全局共享，请先在网络管理中网络激活此插件，然后返回此处。在插件未网络激"
"活时，只有本地站点配置可用。"

#: src/Admin/Pages/GlobalSettingsPage.php:379
msgid ""
"To use network‑level global configuration, please enable WordPress Multisite "
"first. In a single‑site environment only local site configuration is "
"available."
msgstr ""
"要使用网络级全局配置，请先启用 WordPress 多站点。在单站点环境中，只有本地站点"
"配置可用。"

#: src/Admin/Pages/GlobalSettingsPage.php:387
msgid "Shared data source site"
msgstr "共享数据源站点"

#: src/Admin/Pages/GlobalSettingsPage.php:391
msgid ""
"Multisite network is not enabled. Only the current site data will be used."
msgstr "未启用多站点网络。仅使用当前站点数据。"

#: src/Admin/Pages/GlobalSettingsPage.php:393
msgid ""
"The plugin is not network‑activated, so a shared data source site cannot be "
"selected."
msgstr "插件未网络激活，因此无法选择共享数据源站点。"

#: src/Admin/Pages/GlobalSettingsPage.php:395
msgid ""
"No available network sites were found; the current site will be used as the "
"data source by default."
msgstr "未找到可用的网络站点；默认使用当前站点作为数据源。"

#: src/Admin/Pages/GlobalSettingsPage.php:405
msgid ""
"When network sharing is enabled, the plugin tables from the selected site "
"will be used as the shared data source across the network."
msgstr "启用网络共享后，将使用所选站点的插件表作为网络范围内的共享数据源。"

#: src/Admin/Pages/GlobalSettingsPage.php:412
msgid "hreflang tags"
msgstr "hreflang 标签"

#: src/Admin/Pages/GlobalSettingsPage.php:418
msgid ""
"Output hreflang tags in the front‑end <head> section "
"(wpmmcc_ml_hreflang_links)."
msgstr "在前端 <head> 部分输出 hreflang 标签（wpmmcc_ml_hreflang_links）。"

#: src/Admin/Pages/GlobalSettingsPage.php:421
msgid ""
"When disabled, template tags and related hooks will no longer output "
"hreflang tags, but canonical and other SEO settings remain unaffected."
msgstr ""
"禁用时，模板标签和相关钩子将不再输出 hreflang 标签，但规范链接和其他 SEO 设置"
"不受影响。"

#: src/Admin/Pages/GlobalSettingsPage.php:428
msgid "Canonical tag"
msgstr "规范链接标签"

#: src/Admin/Pages/GlobalSettingsPage.php:434
msgid ""
"Output the canonical tag in the front‑end <head> section "
"(wpmmcc_ml_canonical_url)."
msgstr "在前端 <head> 部分输出规范链接标签（wpmmcc_ml_canonical_url）。"

#: src/Admin/Pages/GlobalSettingsPage.php:437
msgid ""
"When disabled, the plugin will no longer output canonical tags, which is "
"suitable when another SEO plugin manages canonical URLs."
msgstr ""
"禁用时，插件将不再输出规范链接标签，适用于由其他 SEO 插件管理规范链接的情况。"

#: src/Admin/Pages/GlobalSettingsPage.php:444
msgid "Handling of deleted translated content"
msgstr "已删除翻译内容的处理"

#: src/Admin/Pages/GlobalSettingsPage.php:450
msgid "Create new translated content (keep the old record in the trash)."
msgstr "创建新的翻译内容（将旧记录保留在回收站）。"

#: src/Admin/Pages/GlobalSettingsPage.php:455
msgid "Reuse the deleted content ID (restore from trash and overwrite)."
msgstr "重用已删除内容的 ID（从回收站恢复并覆盖）。"

#: src/Admin/Pages/GlobalSettingsPage.php:459
msgid ""
"When a translated post is deleted (moved to the trash), you can choose "
"whether to reuse the original post ID by restoring it from the trash, or "
"create a brand new translated post. The default behavior is to create a new "
"post."
msgstr ""
"当翻译的文章被删除（移至回收站）时，您可以选择通过从回收站恢复来重用原文章 "
"ID，或创建全新的翻译文章。默认行为是创建新文章。"

#: src/Admin/Pages/GlobalSettingsPage.php:465
msgid "Data retention on uninstall"
msgstr "卸载时的数据保留"

#: src/Admin/Pages/GlobalSettingsPage.php:471
msgid "Keep plugin data when uninstalling (for easy reinstallation)."
msgstr "卸载时保留插件数据（便于重新安装）。"

#: src/Admin/Pages/GlobalSettingsPage.php:474
msgid ""
"When enabled, database tables and settings will be preserved when the plugin "
"is deleted. This allows you to reinstall the plugin without losing data. "
"Disable this option if you want to completely remove all plugin data."
msgstr ""
"启用后，删除插件时会保留数据库表和设置。这样您重新安装插件时无需担心数据丢"
"失。如果您希望彻底移除所有插件数据，请关闭此选项。"

#: src/Admin/Pages/GlobalSettingsPage.php:511
msgid "Task Queue Settings"
msgstr "任务队列设置"

#: src/Admin/Pages/GlobalSettingsPage.php:512
msgid ""
"Configure Action Scheduler task queue behavior and maintenance settings."
msgstr "配置 Action Scheduler 任务队列行为和维护设置。"

#: src/Admin/Pages/GlobalSettingsPage.php:518
#: src/Admin/Pages/SettingsPage.php:86
msgid "Queue Batch Size"
msgstr "队列批处理大小"

#: src/Admin/Pages/GlobalSettingsPage.php:521
#: src/Admin/Pages/SettingsPage.php:89
msgid ""
"Maximum tasks processed in a single Action Scheduler run, recommended 5-25."
msgstr "单次 Action Scheduler 运行中处理的最大任务数，建议 5-25。"

#: src/Admin/Pages/GlobalSettingsPage.php:525
#: src/Admin/Pages/SettingsPage.php:93
msgid "Concurrent Batches"
msgstr "并发批次"

#: src/Admin/Pages/GlobalSettingsPage.php:528
#: src/Admin/Pages/SettingsPage.php:96
msgid ""
"Number of batches allowed to run simultaneously, typically keep at 1, can "
"increase when resources are sufficient."
msgstr "允许同时运行的批次数量，通常保持为 1，资源充足时可增加。"

#: src/Admin/Pages/GlobalSettingsPage.php:532
#: src/Admin/Pages/SettingsPage.php:100
msgid "Time Limit (seconds)"
msgstr "时间限制（秒）"

#: src/Admin/Pages/GlobalSettingsPage.php:535
#: src/Admin/Pages/SettingsPage.php:103
msgid ""
"Maximum runtime for a single Action Scheduler batch execution to avoid "
"excessive resource usage."
msgstr "单次 Action Scheduler 批处理执行的最大运行时间，以避免过度使用资源。"

#: src/Admin/Pages/GlobalSettingsPage.php:539
#: src/Admin/Pages/SettingsPage.php:107
msgid "Execution Timeout (seconds)"
msgstr "执行超时（秒）"

#: src/Admin/Pages/GlobalSettingsPage.php:542
#: src/Admin/Pages/SettingsPage.php:110
msgid ""
"Tasks not completed within this time will be considered stalled and marked "
"as failed."
msgstr "在此时间内未完成的任务将被视为停滞并标记为失败。"

#: src/Admin/Pages/GlobalSettingsPage.php:546
#: src/Admin/Pages/SettingsPage.php:114
msgid "Maintenance Check Interval (seconds)"
msgstr "维护检查间隔（秒）"

#: src/Admin/Pages/GlobalSettingsPage.php:549
#: src/Admin/Pages/SettingsPage.php:117
msgid ""
"Frequency of periodic queue checks and cleanup, recommended 300 seconds."
msgstr "定期队列检查和清理的频率，建议 300 秒。"

#: src/Admin/Pages/GlobalSettingsPage.php:553
#: src/Admin/Pages/SettingsPage.php:121
msgid "Overwrite Existing Data When Syncing"
msgstr "同步时覆盖现有数据"

#: src/Admin/Pages/GlobalSettingsPage.php:557
#: src/Admin/Pages/SettingsPage.php:125
msgid "Overwrite existing data on target site when syncing translations."
msgstr "同步翻译时覆盖目标站点上的现有数据。"

#: src/Admin/Pages/GlobalSettingsPage.php:562
#: src/Admin/Pages/SettingsPage.php:130
msgid "Task Retention Days"
msgstr "任务保留天数"

#: src/Admin/Pages/GlobalSettingsPage.php:565
#: src/Admin/Pages/SettingsPage.php:133
msgid "Tasks and logs older than this will be automatically cleaned up."
msgstr "超过此天数的任务和日志将被自动清理。"

#: src/Admin/Pages/GlobalSettingsPage.php:569
#: src/Admin/Pages/SettingsPage.php:137
msgid "Translation Max Retries"
msgstr "翻译最大重试次数"

#: src/Admin/Pages/GlobalSettingsPage.php:572
#: src/Admin/Pages/SettingsPage.php:140
msgid ""
"Maximum number of retries after a translation request fails, recommended 3. "
"Set to 0 to disable retries."
msgstr "翻译请求失败后的最大重试次数，建议 3。设为 0 可禁用重试。"

#: src/Admin/Pages/GlobalSettingsPage.php:576
#: src/Admin/Pages/SettingsPage.php:144
msgid "Translation Retry Delay (seconds)"
msgstr "翻译重试延迟（秒）"

#: src/Admin/Pages/GlobalSettingsPage.php:579
#: src/Admin/Pages/SettingsPage.php:147
msgid ""
"Delay before each retry (seconds), recommended 1-3 seconds. Prevents rate "
"limiting from frequent requests."
msgstr "每次重试前的延迟（秒），建议 1-3 秒。防止频繁请求触发速率限制。"

#: src/Admin/Pages/GlobalSettingsPage.php:583
#: src/Admin/Pages/SettingsPage.php:151
msgid "Enable Database Scan"
msgstr "启用数据库扫描"

#: src/Admin/Pages/GlobalSettingsPage.php:587
#: src/Admin/Pages/SettingsPage.php:155
msgid ""
"Include database content (theme_mods, custom fields, etc.) when scanning "
"themes. Especially important for block themes."
msgstr ""
"扫描主题时包含数据库内容（theme_mods、自定义字段等）。对于块主题尤为重要。"

#: src/Admin/Pages/GlobalSettingsPage.php:600
#: src/Admin/Pages/SettingsPage.php:166
msgid "Task Log Cleanup"
msgstr "任务日志清理"

#: src/Admin/Pages/GlobalSettingsPage.php:602
#: src/Admin/Pages/SettingsPage.php:168
msgid ""
"When automatic cleanup fails, you can manually delete task logs older than a "
"specified number of days here. This operation does not create new task "
"records."
msgstr ""
"当自动清理失败时，您可以在此手动删除超过指定天数的任务日志。此操作不会创建新"
"的任务记录。"

#: src/Admin/Pages/GlobalSettingsPage.php:604
#: src/Admin/Pages/SettingsPage.php:170
msgid ""
"Risk Warning: Log deletion is irreversible. After deletion, you will not be "
"able to view historical task execution details. Only proceed after "
"confirming these logs are no longer needed."
msgstr ""
"风险警告：日志删除不可逆。删除后，您将无法查看历史任务执行详情。请确认这些日"
"志不再需要后再继续。"

#: src/Admin/Pages/GlobalSettingsPage.php:613
#: src/Admin/Pages/SettingsPage.php:179
msgid "Delete All Logs Older Than 3 Days"
msgstr "删除 3 天前的所有日志"

#: src/Admin/Pages/GlobalSettingsPage.php:616
#: src/Admin/Pages/SettingsPage.php:182
msgid "Delete All Logs Older Than 10 Days"
msgstr "删除 10 天前的所有日志"

#: src/Admin/Pages/GlobalSettingsPage.php:618
#: src/Admin/Pages/SettingsPage.php:184
msgid ""
"Are you sure you want to delete all task logs? This action cannot be undone."
msgstr "您确定要删除所有任务日志吗？此操作无法撤消。"

#: src/Admin/Pages/GlobalSettingsPage.php:619
#: src/Admin/Pages/SettingsPage.php:185
