msgstr "未选择有效的日志清理范围。"

#: src/Admin/Pages/GlobalSettingsPage.php:753
#: src/Admin/Pages/SettingsPage.php:263
msgid ""
"Task log table does not exist or has not been created yet, no cleanup needed."
msgstr "任务日志表不存在或尚未创建，无需清理。"

#: src/Admin/Pages/GlobalSettingsPage.php:769
#: src/Admin/Pages/SettingsPage.php:280
